<div class="mandarin-hanzi">米饭</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">mǐfàn</div>

''Meaning:'' cooked rice  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
中午我吃米饭和鸡蛋。 — Zhōngwǔ wǒ chī mǐfàn hé jīdàn. — At noon I eat rice and eggs.

!! Usage note
Refers to cooked rice; distinguish from 生米 “uncooked rice.”
